              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "The petitioner argues that warrantless caretaking inside a home should be allowed only under consent or exigent circumstances; an absolute prohibition is contrary to the Fourth Amendment\u2019s reasonableness standard."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Petitioner Position",
      "status": "complete",
      "summary": null,
      "summary_citations": []
    },
    {
