              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 50,
                "start": 50
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "The respondents contend that community caretaking without a warrant should be permitted when objectively reasonable, to prevent death or injury."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Respondents Position",
