          }
        ],
        "text": "By rejecting the broad \u201ccommunity caretaking\u201d theory, the Court limits warrantless home entries to the established exigent\u2011circumstances analysis, reinforcing the Fourth Amendment\u2019s special protection of the home."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "49fd95ba2b463c1501f57d762c31bb9c60902eb78fc5c79ad07c101bfa0c29a1",
