            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The decision clarifies that lower courts must apply the traditional exigent\u2011circumstances doctrine rather than a generalized caretaking rule, shaping future Fourth Amendment litigation."
      }
    ],
